    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "That's a good start, thanks. To make it a bit more engaging for the students, could you elaborate on why the reaction feels so sudden and \"aggressive\"? Like, why is it such a sharp, almost mischievous sting rather than just a slow burn? It seems like the compounds hit you all at once out of nowhere.",
